"var PS_PATH_STRIP = String.raw`\"(?:${PATH_KEYS.join(\"|\")})\"\\s*:\\s*\"(?:[^\"\\\\]|\\\\.)*\"|\"workspace_roots\"\\s*:\\s*\\[[^\\]]*\\]`;",
